      "title": "Tar Files Created on macOS Display Errors When Extracting on Linux (2024)",
      "source": "hackernews-top",
      "url": "https://aruljohn.com/blog/macos-created-tar-files-linux-errors/",
      "hn_url": "https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=47961208",
      "description": "",
      "hn_score": 134,
      "comments": 90,
      "collected_at": "2026-05-04T15:45:31.826481+00:00",
      "published_at": "2026-05-04T15:45:31.826481+00:00",
      "summary": "macOS 创建的 tar 文件在 Linux 上解压时出现错误的兼容性问题。根本原因是 macOS tar 实现添加的扩展属性（extended attributes）和资源分叉（resource forks）在 Linux 环境中无法正确处理。解决方案包括使用 --no-xattrs 参数、COPYFILE_DISABLE 环境变量或采用跨平台兼容的打包工具。该问题影响跨操作系统的文件分发、CI/CD 流程和开发工具链，对需要支持多平台的开源项目和企业环境具有实际参考价值。",
      "tags": [
        "developer-tools",
        "open-source",
        "workflow-automation"
      ],
      "score": 6.2,
      "analyzed_at": "2026-05-04T15:48:11.545914+00:00"
